on exitFrame
  [  0] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [  3] pusharglist 1 ........................... <1>
  [  5] extcall 42 .............................. <soundBusy(1)>
  [  8] not ..................................... <not soundBusy(1)>
  [  9] jmpifz [ 17] ............................ if not soundBusy(1) then
  [ 12] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [ 14] extcall 41 .............................. play done
  [ 17] ret
end
